WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
Compare the two workflows. Today,
engineers interpret requirements,

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.960
prepare cases and data,
wait for a shared environment,

00:00:07.008 --> 00:00:11.360
then collect evidence manually.
The target adds approved context,

00:00:11.406 --> 00:00:14.520
repeatable execution and retained results.

00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:18.880
AI can propose a test or draft a
diagnostic explanation at the appropriate

00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:22.800
stage. A human reviews
the result before it progresses.

00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:26.000
This is a pilot target: foundation work,

00:00:26.046 --> 00:00:30.320
review effort and rework must be
measured alongside any faster drafting.
